sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant A as Agent
  participant P as Policy
  participant B as Tool broker
  participant T as Tool or MCP
  participant M as Memory
  participant L as Audit

  U->>A: Goal
  M-->>A: Retrieved memory
  A->>P: Proposed plan
  alt Allowed
    P->>B: Allow
    B->>T: Scoped call
    T-->>A: Result
  else Denied
    P-->>A: Deny or revise
  end
  A->>M: Memory write
  P->>L: Trace
  B->>L: Trace
  T->>L: Trace
  M->>L: Trace
